Description: scaladoc: take jQuery from libjs-jquery
 Upstream's sbt build extracts jquery.min.js from an org.webjars jar and
 scaladoc checks it against a pinned Subresource Integrity hash. Debian has
 no webjars; it ships the same jQuery version (3.7.1) in libjs-jquery, with
 a minified file rebuilt in Debian, so the upstream hash cannot match. Read
 it from /usr/share/javascript/jquery/ and drop the check.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-02
